   }
  },
  {
   "sid": "s4",
   "date": "2025-06-04",
   "url": "https://www.ftc.gov/system/files/ftc_gov/pdf/Transcript-The-Attention-Economy-How-Big-Tech-Firms-Exploit-Children-and-Hurt-Families-06-04-25.pdf",
   "text": "One thing that's changed recently and was brought up just a moment ago very finally about the chatbots, this idea of the sort of deception that you're talking to someone who might care about you in some way when it's really the equivalent of a amphibian or Komodo dragon level predator of your time. It does not care about you at all. That's a problem. And also they still lie. And even if they tell you the truth, they only tell you the sycophantic and flattering truth. It's the road to democratic tyranny. Every child a tyrant because all they're surrounded by flatterers. And that's actually a big problem.",
   "source_type": "official_statement",
   "attribution": {
    "kind": "personal",
    "speaker": "Chris Mufarrige",
    "organization_id": "ftc_bcp",
    "basis": "local_span",
    "note": "Automated extraction; exact quote and attribution span matched the retrieved source."
   },
   "analysis": {
    "status": "pending",
    "a": {},
    "b": {},
    "topics": [],
    "confidence": {},
    "escalated": [],
    "models": {},
    "assessments": {}
   }
  },
  {
   "sid": "s5",
   "date": "2025-06-04",
   "url": "https://www.ftc.gov/system/files/ftc_gov/pdf/Transcript-The-Attention-Economy-How-Big-Tech-Firms-Exploit-Children-and-Hurt-Families-06-04-25.pdf",
   "text": "Part of AI's problem is false imagery where you can't believe what you see video testimonials that are fake. That's something I've advocated for, a lot of people in this room have heard me go off before about the need for non-expert watermarking for AI imagery and AI presentation so people know they're dealing with an inhuman presentation, facsimile of humanity.",
   "source_type": "official_statement",
   "attribution": {
    "kind": "personal",
    "speaker": "Chris Mufarrige",
    "organization_id": "ftc_bcp",
    "basis": "local_span",
    "note": "Automated extraction; exact quote and attribution span matched the retrieved source."
   },
   "analysis": {
    "status": "pending",
    "a": {},
    "b": {},
    "topics": [],
    "confidence": {},
    "escalated": [],
    "models": {},
    "assessments": {}
   }
  },
  {
   "sid": "s6",
   "date": "2025-06-04",
   "url": "https://www.ftc.gov/system/files/ftc_gov/pdf/Transcript-The-Attention-Economy-How-Big-Tech-Firms-Exploit-Children-and-Hurt-Families-06-04-25.pdf",
   "text": "Because I also think, again, it's not artificial intelligence. You cannot make intelligence, and that's a long philosophical argument, but it's not possible. And it does not matter how fast or awesome those virtual chips get, it will never come to be. It's a logical impossibility and it's a sales tactic. And so we shouldn't pretend like something intelligent is talking to anyone. It's a calculative high-speed machine, and as such it'll be cold and as such it'll be inhuman. And if you leave that machine with your children, it will do inhuman things to your child no matter what.",
   "source_type": "official_statement",
   "attribution": {
    "kind": "personal",
    "speaker": "Chris Mufarrige",
    "organization_id": "ftc_bcp",
    "basis": "local_span",
    "note": "Automated extraction; exact quote and attribution span matched the retrieved source."
   },
   "analysis": {
    "status": "pending",
    "a": {},
    "b": {},
    "topics": [],
    "confidence": {},
    "escalated": [],
    "models": {},
    "assessments": {}
   }
  },
  {
   "sid": "s7",
   "date": "2025-06-04",
   "url": "https://www.ftc.gov/system/files/ftc_gov/pdf/Transcript-The-Attention-Economy-How-Big-Tech-Firms-Exploit-Children-and-Hurt-Families-06-04-25.pdf",
   "text": "No matter. Even if they don't do horrible things like the poor kid in Florida, they will still become less human, period. And I think we've got to get there and think more rigorously and philosophically about the flim-flammery that's being sold. These are tools. They have their uses, but they're not intelligent.",
   "source_type": "official_statement",
   "attribution": {
    "kind": "personal",
    "speaker": "Chris Mufarrige",
    "organization_id": "ftc_bcp",
